      Q. Q. 3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْلَنْقَى</span></b> , of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِفْعَنْلَى</span>, (S,)
<i>He lay,</i> or <i>slept,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَامَ</span>,) <i>on his back;</i> (Seer, S, O,
K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَلْقَى</span> [which belongs to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لقى</span>];
(O, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسلّق</span></b> . (TA.)

